The '''[[2024–25 in Scottish football|2024–25 season]]''' was [[Celtic F.C.|Celtic]]'s 131st season of competitive football.

==Pre-season and friendlies==
Celtic faced [[Ayr United F.C.|Ayr United]] and [[Queen's Park F.C.|Queen's Park]] in early July.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://ayrunitedfc.co.uk/celtic-coming-to-somerset-park | title=Celtic Coming To Somerset Park | publisher=Ayr United FC | date=24 May 2024 | access-date=24 May 2024 | archive-date=24 May 2024 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240524141117/https://ayrunitedfc.co.uk/celtic-coming-to-somerset-park | url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2024/may/31/pre-season-friendly---queen-s-park-v-celtic--wednesday-july--10/ | title=Pre-Season Friendly – Queen's Park v Celtic, Wednesday, July 10 | publisher=Celtic FC | date=31 May 2024 | access-date=31 May 2024}}</ref> They then travelled to the United States, where they played friendlies against [[D.C. United]], [[Manchester City F.C.|Manchester City]] and [[Chelsea F.C.|Chelsea]].<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2024/march/18/celtic-set-to-take-on-chelsea-at-notre-dame-during-2024-usa-tour/ | title=Celtic set to take on Chelsea at Notre Dame during 2024 USA Tour | publisher=Celtic FC | date=18 March 2024 | access-date=15 May 2024 | archive-date=15 May 2024 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240515222028/https://www.celticfc.com/news/2024/march/18/celtic-set-to-take-on-chelsea-at-notre-dame-during-2024-usa-tour/ | url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2024/march/19/celtic-s-us-line-up-complete-as-club-to-meet-epl-champions-manchester-city-and-top-mls-side-dc-united/ | title=Celtic's US line up complete as club to meet EPL Champions Manchester City and top MLS side DC United | publisher=Celtic FC | date=19 March 2024 | access-date=15 May 2024 | archive-date=15 May 2024 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240515222027/https://www.celticfc.com/news/2024/march/19/celtic-s-us-line-up-complete-as-club-to-meet-epl-champions-manchester-city-and-top-mls-side-dc-united/ | url-status=live }}</ref>

