==Scottish Premiership==
{{Main|2024–25 Scottish Premiership}}
The Premiership fixture list was announced on 27 June 2024.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2024/june/27/celtic-kick-off-title-defence-at-home-against-kilmarnock/ | title=Celtic kick-off title defence at home against Kilmarnock | publisher=Celtic FC | date=27 June 2024 | access-date=29 June 2024 | archive-date=29 June 2024 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240629145842/https://www.celticfc.com/news/2024/june/27/celtic-kick-off-title-defence-at-home-against-kilmarnock/ | url-status=live }}</ref> Celtic began their title defence against Kilmarnock at Celtic Park.

