==Scottish Cup==
{{Main|2024–25 Scottish Cup}}
On 2 December, Celtic were drawn to face [[Kilmarnock F.C.|Kilmarnock]] at Celtic Park in the fourth round of the [[2024–25 Scottish Cup]].<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2024/december/02/celtic-take-on-kilmarnock-in-scottish-cup-fourth-round/ | title=Celtic take on Kilmarnock in Scottish Cup fourth round | publisher=Celtic FC | date=2 December 2024 | access-date=3 December 2024 | archive-date=3 December 2024 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241203045231/https://www.celticfc.com/news/2024/december/02/celtic-take-on-kilmarnock-in-scottish-cup-fourth-round/ | url-status=live }}</ref> On 20 January 2025, Celtic were drawn to face [[Raith Rovers F.C.|Raith Rovers]] at Celtic Park in the fifth round.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2025/january/20/celtic-at-home-to-raith-rovers-in-scottish-cup/ | title=Celtic at home to Raith Rovers in Scottish Cup | publisher=Celtic FC | date=20 January 2025 | access-date=24 January 2025 | archive-date=21 January 2025 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250121103723/https://www.celticfc.com/news/2025/january/20/celtic-at-home-to-raith-rovers-in-scottish-cup/ | url-status=live }}</ref> On 10 February, Celtic were drawn to face [[Hibernian F.C.|Hibernian]] at Celtic Park in the quarter-finals.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2025/february/10/celtic-to-face-hibernian-in-scottish-cup-quarter-final/ | title=Celtic to face Hibernian in Scottish Cup quarter-final | publisher=Celtic FC | date=10 February 2025 | access-date=11 February 2025 | archive-date=14 February 2025 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250214184502/https://www.celticfc.com/news/2025/february/10/celtic-to-face-hibernian-in-scottish-cup-quarter-final/ | url-status=live }}</ref> On 10 March, Celtic were drawn to face [[St Johnstone F.C.|St Johnstone]] in the semi-finals.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2025/march/10/celtic-to-face-st-johnstone-in-the-scottish-cup-semi-final/ | title=Celtic to face St Johnstone in the Scottish Cup semi-final | publisher=Celtic FC | date=10 March 2025 | access-date=10 March 2025 | archive-date=12 March 2025 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250312070647/https://www.celticfc.com/news/2025/march/10/celtic-to-face-st-johnstone-in-the-scottish-cup-semi-final/ | url-status=live }}</ref> Celtic faced Aberdeen in the final on 24 May.

