==Scottish League Cup==
{{Main|2024–25 Scottish League Cup}}
On 28 July, Celtic were drawn to face [[Hibernian F.C.|Hibernian]] in the second round of the [[2024–25 Scottish League Cup]].<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2024/july/28/Celtic-to-face-Hibernian-in-last-16-of-Premier-Sports-Cup/ | title=Celtic to face Hibernian in last 16 of Premier Sports Cup | publisher=Celtic FC | date=28 July 2024 | access-date=28 July 2024 | archive-date=28 July 2024 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240728225838/https://www.celticfc.com/news/2024/july/28/Celtic-to-face-Hibernian-in-last-16-of-Premier-Sports-Cup/ | url-status=live }}</ref> On 18 August, Celtic were drawn to face [[Falkirk F.C.|Falkirk]] in the quarter-finals.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2024/august/18/celtic-face-home-tie-against-falkirk-in-league-cup-quarter-final/ | title=Celtic face home tie against Falkirk in League Cup quarter-final | publisher=Celtic FC | date=18 August 2024 | access-date=18 August 2024 | archive-date=19 August 2024 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240819110845/https://www.celticfc.com/news/2024/august/18/celtic-face-home-tie-against-falkirk-in-league-cup-quarter-final/ | url-status=live }}</ref> On 22 September, Celtic were drawn to face [[Aberdeen F.C.|Aberdeen]] in the semi-finals.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2024/september/22/celtic-face-aberdeen-in-league-cup-semi-final/ | title=Celtic face Aberdeen in League Cup semi-final | publisher=Celtic FC | date=22 September 2024 | access-date=22 September 2024 | archive-date=22 September 2024 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240922162832/https://www.celticfc.com/news/2024/september/22/celtic-face-aberdeen-in-league-cup-semi-final/ | url-status=live }}</ref> Celtic faced [[Rangers F.C.|Rangers]] in the final on 15 December.

