==UEFA Champions League==
{{Main|2024–25 UEFA Champions League}}
Celtic entered the UEFA Champions League at the [[2024–25 UEFA Champions League league phase|league phase]].

===League phase===
{{main|2024–25 UEFA Champions League league phase#League phase table}}
On 29 August, the draw for the league phase was made. Celtic were drawn with [[RB Leipzig]] and [[Borussia Dortmund]] (Pot 1), [[Club Brugge KV|Club Brugge]] and [[Atalanta BC|Atalanta]] (Pot 2), [[BSC Young Boys|Young Boys]] and [[GNK Dinamo Zagreb|Dinamo Zagreb]] (Pot 3), and [[ŠK Slovan Bratislava|Slovan Bratislava]] and [[Aston Villa F.C.|Aston Villa]] (Pot 4).<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2024/august/29/celtic-s-2024-25-champions-league-draw-/ | title=Celtic's 2024/25 UEFA Champions League draw | publisher=Celtic FC | date=29 August 2024 | access-date=30 August 2024 | archive-date=30 August 2024 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240830085355/https://www.celticfc.com/news/2024/august/29/celtic-s-2024-25-champions-league-draw-/ | url-status=live }}</ref>

{{:2024–25 UEFA Champions League league phase|transcludesection=Table|showteam=CEL}}

