===Knockout phase play-offs===
{{main|2024–25 UEFA Champions League knockout phase#Knockout phase play-offs}}
The draw for the knockout phase play-offs was held on 31 January 2025. Celtic were drawn against [[FC Bayern Munich|Bayern Munich]], as a result of finishing the league phase in 21st place.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2025/january/31/celtic-to-face-bayern-munich-in-the-uefa-champions-league-knockout-play-off/ | title=Celtic to face Bayern Munich in the UEFA Champions League knockout play-off | publisher=Celtic FC | date=31 January 2025 | access-date=3 February 2025}}</ref>

