===Kit===
'''Supplier:''' [[Adidas]] / '''Sponsors:''' [[Dafabet]] (front) and [[Magners]] (back)

The club is in the fifth year of a deal with [[Adidas]] – the club's official kit supplier.<ref>{{cite web | url=http://www.celticfc.com/news/17678 | title=Celtic announce magnificent new five-year partnership with adidas | publisher=Celtic FC | date=13 March 2020 | access-date=25 May 2020 | archive-date=2 December 2020 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20201202221352/https://www.celticfc.com/news/17678/ | url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite web | url=http://www.celticfc.com/news/18279 | title=Celtic welcomes adidas | publisher=Celtic FC | date=1 July 2020 | access-date=1 July 2020 | archive-date=2 December 2020 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20201202221347/https://www.celticfc.com/news/18279/ | url-status=live }}</ref>

