*'''Home:''' The home kit features the traditional green and white hoops with a dark green trim, and a [[Celtic knot]] collar detail. White shorts and socks complete the look.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2024/may/29/adidas-x-celtic-fc-reveal-2024-25-home-kit--pre-order-now/ | title=adidas x Celtic FC reveal 2024/25 Home Kit: Pre-order now | publisher=Celtic FC | date=29 May 2024 | access-date=30 May 2024 | archive-date=30 May 2024 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240530084059/https://www.celticfc.com/news/2024/may/29/adidas-x-celtic-fc-reveal-2024-25-home-kit--pre-order-now/ | url-status=live }}</ref>
*'''Away:''' The away kit features a yellow shirt with green hoops, and an embroidered four-leaf clover. The shirt is accompanied by green shorts and yellow socks.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2024/july/22/adidas-x-celtic-fc-reveal-2024-25-away-kit---pre-order-now/ | title=adidas x Celtic FC reveal 2024/25 Away Kit: Pre-order now | publisher=Celtic FC | date=22 July 2024 | access-date=24 July 2024 | archive-date=23 July 2024 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240723152131/https://www.celticfc.com/news/2024/july/22/adidas-x-celtic-fc-reveal-2024-25-away-kit---pre-order-now/ | url-status=live }}</ref>
*'''Third:''' The third kit features a dark green shirt with a camouflage design. The shirt is accompanied by matching shorts and socks.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2024/august/21/headline--adidas-x-celtic-fc-reveal-2024-25-third-kit---pre-order-now/ | title=adidas x Celtic FC reveal 2024/25 Third Kit - Pre-order now | publisher=Celtic FC | date=21 August 2024 | access-date=21 August 2024 | archive-date=21 August 2024 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240821202036/https://www.celticfc.com/news/2024/august/21/headline--adidas-x-celtic-fc-reveal-2024-25-third-kit---pre-order-now/ | url-status=live }}</ref>

